">NDR</a>, XDR), инструменты анализа кода (<a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%9A%D0%B8%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C_-_SAST_-_Static_Application_Security_Testing_-_DevSecTestOps_-_%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5_%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE_%D1%8F%D1%89%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0_-_%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%BA_%D1%83%D1%8F%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B9_%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8_%D0%B2_%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%85%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%BC_%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B5_%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F_%D0%BD%D0%B0_%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%85_%D1%8D%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%85_%D0%B6%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE_%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%BB%D0%B0_%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B7%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B1%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BA%D0%B8_%D0%9F%D0%9E\">SAST</a>, <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%9A%D0%B8%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C_-_DAST_-_Dynamic_Application_Security_Testing_-_%D0%94%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B5_%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5_%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8_%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B9\">DAST</a>), <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/Backup_and_Recovery_-_%D0%B1%D1%8D%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%BF_-_%D0%A1%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BC%D1%8B_%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE_%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F_%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%85%D0%B8%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F_%D0%B8_%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F_%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8B%D1%85_-_%D0%A1%D0%A0%D0%9A_%D0%B8_%D0%92%D0%94_-_31_%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%82%D0%B0_%D0%9C%